(Sequence for a schedule_candidate to be dispatched:)
(1. create_candidate ?candidate)
(2. allocate_vehicle_unit ?candidate ?vehicle_unit)
(3. attach_task_profile ?candidate ?route_task_profile)
(4. confirm_candidate_preparedness ?candidate ?route_task_profile (requires candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, candidate_task_profile_linked))
(Now candidate_prepared true.)
(Then we need to link origin/destination availability etc? They are already linked via init: candidate_origin_availability_linked etc. Those are predicates that link candidate to origin/destination availability. Those are already true (given). So we have those links.)
