(So we need dispatch_ready ?candidate. How to get dispatch_ready? For schedule_candidate, dispatch_ready can be set via finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation or finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation or finalize_candidate_direct. Those require candidate_finalized? Actually they set candidate_finalized and dispatch_ready.)
(So we need to finalize the candidate.)
